(7719976, 1270199, 141319, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness what an interesting image! Masterful!</td>', 'Oh my goodness what an interesting image! Masterful!', '2022-05-09 03:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719977, 1270211, 141319, '<td valign="top">Very cool picture.</td>', 'Very cool picture.', '2022-05-09 03:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719978, 1270240, 141319, '<td valign="top">Well seen, great entry for the challenge. Love your composition</td>', 'Well seen, great entry for the challenge. Love your composition', '2022-05-09 03:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719979, 1270192, 141319, '<td valign="top">Oh wow!!</td>', 'Oh wow!!', '2022-05-09 03:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719981, 1270238, 141319, '<td valign="top">For me this doesn''t work. I find your whites blown out and on the "3rds" just merging into the sky, the blacks also without detail, especially on the people. having said all that, I hope its not my monitor.</td>', 'For me this doesn''t work. I find your whites blown out and on the "3rds" just merging into the sky, the blacks also without detail, especially on the people. having said all that, I hope its not my monitor.', '2022-05-09 03:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719991, 1270239, 87808, '<td valign="top">Oh I do like this very much</td>', 'Oh I do like this very much', '2022-05-09 11:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719992, 1270219, 87808, '<td valign="top">Love the simplicity of this, crisp, clean, great leading lines. Brilliant image of something so mundane. 9</td>', 'Love the simplicity of this, crisp, clean, great leading lines. Brilliant image of something so mundane. 9', '2022-05-09 11:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719993, 1270193, 87808, '<td valign="top">this is a gorgeous picture; it infuses me with calm. High contrast to me means very light to very dark. There are really no middle grounds for mid toned colour and I feel that the tea pot in mid-range. Not sure if that makes sense. If the black cups had not been there, the pot would have been the dark contrasting image against the gorgeous flowers. But again, that is just my thoughts. But I will say again that this is a super photo. 7</td>', 'this is a gorgeous picture; it infuses me with calm. High contrast to me means very light to very dark. There are really no middle grounds for mid toned colour and I feel that the tea pot in mid-range. Not sure if that makes sense. If the black cups had not been there, the pot would have been the dark contrasting image against the gorgeous flowers. But again, that is just my thoughts. But I will say again that this is a super photo. 7', '2022-05-09 11:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719994, 1270174, 87808, '<td valign="top">It is lovely to see high contrast in colour, when it is done well. You nailed it Imo. Also, I just dropped my pen on the floor and best to pick it up and this also looks fabulous sideways, it is like a fantastic leading line that then blooms off in two directions!!</td>', 'It is lovely to see high contrast in colour, when it is done well. You nailed it Imo. Also, I just dropped my pen on the floor and best to pick it up and this also looks fabulous sideways, it is like a fantastic leading line that then blooms off in two directions!!', '2022-05-09 11:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719997, 1270230, 87808, '<td valign="top">They are so cute! It feels like it is blown out a tad, it is almost too much but it is a super high contrast.</td>', 'They are so cute! It feels like it is blown out a tad, it is almost too much but it is a super high contrast.', '2022-05-09 11:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719998, 1270184, 87808, '<td valign="top">I, personally and not seeing that high contrast in this. If the orchid had been a more vivid white it would have worked. Bit as it is, it just seems more low key and grey.</td>', 'I, personally and not seeing that high contrast in this. If the orchid had been a more vivid white it would have worked. Bit as it is, it just seems more low key and grey.', '2022-05-09 11:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7719999, 1270245, 87808, '<td valign="top">Great photo, tack sharp, clean lines. But I am not sure it screams high contrast. Maybe if you cropped to the black buildings and closer crop to the front of the buildings, you would have that blackness and then that fabulous swoosh of cloud that you could have dodged or highlighted.</td>', 'Great photo, tack sharp, clean lines. But I am not sure it screams high contrast. Maybe if you cropped to the black buildings and closer crop to the front of the buildings, you would have that blackness and then that fabulous swoosh of cloud that you could have dodged or highlighted.', '2022-05-09 12:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7720000, 1270228, 87808, '<td valign="top">It is a lovely portrait!</td>', 'It is a lovely portrait!', '2022-05-09 12:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7720001, 1270238, 87808, '<td valign="top">I really like this, it could be anywhere in the world, you could have said it was from Paris or London and I would have believed you. And that is great in a photo and that is what photos are meant to do, spark your imagination. He could be writing the next cats or writing a music score and waiting on his orchestra or reading a book. It''s awesome, chopping that fellow out of the right-hand side might have been nice, but it works both ways. Well done</td>', 'I really like this, it could be anywhere in the world, you could have said it was from Paris or London and I would have believed you. And that is great in a photo and that is what photos are meant to do, spark your imagination. He could be writing the next cats or writing a music score and waiting on his orchestra or reading a book. It''s awesome, chopping that fellow out of the right-hand side might have been nice, but it works both ways. Well done', '2022-05-09 12:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
